<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Weygandt Basin</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:208-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.414500" lon="-121.602200"><ele>1161.3</ele><name>Nordic skiers' sno-park (Tilly Jane Sno-Park)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:cooper-spur-sno-park (OSM way 551745125); confidence: high; pdf_page: 210; book_elev_ft: 3800; quote: map 43: NORDIC SKIER PARKING 3800'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.422913" lon="-121.614247"><ele>1224.1</ele><name>Small quarry; road angles off right</name><desc>source: OSM node 33428020, Cloud Cap Road NF 3512 x NF 3512012 (way 762672816), the only road leaving the Cloud Cap road on the right in its first 2.4 mi; 1.19 mi from the pin by OSM, DEM 4,016 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 211; book_elev_ft: 4000; quote: Ski up the Cloud Cap road 1.4 miles to a small, clifflike quarry on the left side of the road. Opposite the quarry a road angles off to the right.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.426915" lon="-121.615195"><ele>1191.3</ele><name>Weygandt Basin clearcuts (low point)</name><desc>source: OSM NF 3512012 vertex at its low point, DEM 3,908 ft, 0.47 mi from the quarry; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 211; book_elev_ft: 3900; quote: Follow this road 0.8 mile to the basinlike clearcuts for fine views. (map 43: WEYGANDT BASIN 3900')</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.428370" lon="-121.615992"><ele>1206.5</ele><name>NF 3512012 meets NF 3511631</name><desc>source: OSM node 33427466; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 210; quote: map 43: road junction north of the basin</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.429098" lon="-121.619482"><ele>1222.6</ele><name>Weygandt Summit (north rim of the basin)</name><desc>source: OSM NF 3511631 node 33439642, its high point (DEM 4,011 ft); from here the road descends via NF 3511630 to Road 3511 in 0.5 mi (book 0.4); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 211; book_elev_ft: 4020; quote: The road continues over the north rim of the basin (Weygandt Summit, 4,020 feet) and descends 0.4 mile to Road 3511.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Weygandt Basin</name><desc>1. Nordic skiers' sno-park (Tilly Jane Sno-Park) -&gt; Small quarry; road angles off right: osm (high), 1.19 mi | 2. Small quarry; road angles off right -&gt; Weygandt Basin clearcuts (low point): osm (high), 0.47 mi | 3. Weygandt Basin clearcuts (low point) -&gt; NF 3512012 meets NF 3511631: osm (high), 0.13 mi | 4. NF 3512012 meets NF 3511631 -&gt; Weygandt Summit (north rim of the basin): osm (medium), 0.21 mi</desc>
